cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  RAISR-SME: Polarity-Separated Cyber-AI Risk Triage Under Epistemic Uncertainty
  and Longitudinal Breach Reporting Salience in Small and Medium-Sized Enterprises
message: >-
  If you use the RAISR-SME instrument, item bank, or empirical and Monte Carlo
  replication suite, please cite this software package and the accompanying
  ICIIT 2027 manuscript.
type: software
